## 6. Dependency Isolation (wajib sesuai SPECIFICATION.md §4)

```
/backend
  /requirements-web.txt   # FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Alembic, httpx, pydantic, uvicorn
  /requirements-ai.txt    # torch, faster-whisper, ffmpeg-python
  /venv (atau conda env terpisah per kebutuhan jika perlu isolasi CUDA)
```

Agent **wajib** menempatkan import AI-heavy (torch, faster-whisper) hanya
di modul yang dipanggil oleh job worker, bukan di top-level `main.py`, agar
startup web server tetap ringan.

